        <p>Filtering dozens of factories eats weeks you should be spending on product. Send us your jacket type, target order volume, and destination market, and YAUUM will return a shortlist matched to those requirements. Prefer to talk it through first? Book a sourcing consultation and we will walk your options line by line</p>
